  "content": "\n\n<h1>Zero Ordinary Vehicles 包</h1>\n<p>Zero Ordinary Vehicles 是一款专注于历史装甲车辆、武器及相关组件的 MTS/IV 内容包。目前包含法国超重型坦克——<strong>Char 2C</strong>、<strong>GAZ-AA</strong> 卡车&nbsp;以及一门野战炮 <strong>Mle 1897</strong>。</p>\n<h2>预览</h2>\n<h3>Char 2C</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ecac7d90-c019-4562-9e4d-528db6451695.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h3>Mle 1897</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_52f774b2-4e12-46e6-9877-5a2679bd6f76.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h3>GAZ-AA</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1524417/description_9b7d0d42-b446-401e-8dd5-4360256456b7.png\"></p>\n<h3>Saint-Chamond</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1524417/description_87c9a909-ca97-4e22-b4f4-b7029c732c64.png\"></p>\n<h2>其他&nbsp;</h2>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/3jcMhHgf8X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a></strong></p>\n<p>需要&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Vehicles</a></strong> 和&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/transport-simulator-official-vehicle-set\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Official Content Pack</a></strong></p>",
